        "contentType": "html",
        "content": "<b>Updated policy: Sick leave notification</b><br>Employees notify their manager before 9:00 on the first day of absence. A medical certificate is required from the 2nd consecutive day of absence. Absences longer than 10 working days must also be reported to the HR mailbox.<br>Full policy on the HR SharePoint."
